			"notes": "## Compatibility & Requirements\n\nRem’s AI Companion is a **client-side mod**. Servers do not need to install it. Download the file matching your **exact Minecraft version**.\n\nAll Fabric builds are compiled against **Fabric Loader 0.19.5** and have been tested by the author with **Fabric Loader 0.20.1**.\n\n**Fabric API is required.** The versions below are the API versions used for each build.\n\n| Minecraft | Fabric Loader build baseline | Fabric API build baseline | Required Java |\n|-----------|------------------------------|---------------------------|---------------|\n| 1.18.2    | 0.19.5                       | 0.77.0+1.18.2             | 17+           |\n| 1.20.1    | 0.19.5                       | 0.92.12+1.20.1            | 17+           |\n| 1.21.1    | 0.19.5                       | 0.116.17+1.21.1           | 21+           |\n| 1.21.4    | 0.19.5                       | 0.119.4+1.21.4            | 21+           |\n| 1.21.11   | 0.19.5                       | 0.141.6+1.21.11           | 21+           |\n| 26.2      | 0.19.5                       | 0.161.0+26.2              | 25+           |\n| 26.3      | 0.19.5                       | 0.163.0+26.3              | 25+           |\n\nBuild baselines identify the dependency versions used to compile the mod. They are not a guarantee of compatibility with every newer loader or API release.\n\n### Usage\n\nPress **R** to open the menu. Configure your provider, API key and model in **API Settings**. Press **Esc** to close the menu.\n\nAn internet connection and your own API credentials are required. Provider charges may apply."
		}
